//: # fenwick/api
//: `Fenwick` public 操作の facade
//:
//: ### [目的/もくてき]
//: - `new` / `add` / `sum_prefix` / `sum_range` / `len` / `free` の public path を維持します。
//: - 診断生成、構築、借用 observer、owner-consuming update、区間 query、cleanup を submodule に分けます。
//: - API facade に実装本体を戻さず、internal tree owner を動かす操作と借用で読む操作の境界を見える形に保ちます。

#indent 4
#import "core/math" as *

pub #import "./api/diagnostic" as @merge
pub #import "./api/create" as @merge
pub #import "./api/observer" as @merge
pub #import "./api/update" as @merge
pub #import "./api/query" as @merge
pub #import "./api/cleanup" as @merge
